# Everything the build does not need.
#
# The first build uploaded 213MB because the archive swept in built output,
# caches and the web bundle. EAS installs dependencies on its own machines, so
# none of this has to travel.
node_modules/
dist/
web-build/
.expo/
.expo-shared/
.next/
*.log
.claude/

# Repo-level noise that is not part of the app
../../Images/
